{"product_id":"vampires","title":"Vampires","description":"\u003cp\u003e100 Facts Vampires is a fantastic illustrated children's book for 7-10 year olds, examining the myths and hype that surround the vampire phenomenon. Discover what makes vampires so fascinating, work out how to spot them, and most importantly, learn how to keep them at bay. Get to grips with different vampires around the world and read about the most infamous vampire of all time - Dracula. Exactly 100 numbered facts will challenge children, acting as an incentive as they make their way through the book. Packed with amazing artwork and photographs, and featuring fun panels containing activities, quizzes and cartoons, 100 Facts is an ideal introduction to this fascinating topic. Topics covered: Why do we like vampires?, The power of blood, Sinister signs, Vampire powers, In Africa and America, Monsters from Asia, Blood-drinkers of Europe, Ancient vampires, Dangerous dead, Haunted homelands, The greatest vampire, Dracula s castle, Female vampires, Real-life vampires, Blood-sucking creatures, Scary movies, Vampires in literature, Superstar vampires, 21st century vampires.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Fiona Macdonald \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781848104754 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44938000728217,"sku":"11RF9781848104754","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/53b1377727153504adfd3e025bac257b.jpg?v=1730636232","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/vampires","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}